igital integration, a push toward sustainability and evolving client expectations – these are just some of the trends independent consultants can expect in 2025.\', \'title\': \'Top trends for independent management consultants in 2025\', \'link\': \'https://www.managers.org.uk/knowledge-and-insights/article/top-trends-for-independent-management-consultants-in-2025/\'}, {\'question\': \'What is the outlook for global consulting?\', \'snippet\': \'Global Management Consulting Market size was valued at USD 5,10,645.87 Million in 2025 and is expected to reach at USD 8,97,442.21 Million by 2034 at a CAGR of 6.56% during the forecast period 2025 – 2034.\', \'title\': \'Global Management Consulting Market Size, Share 2034 - CMI\', \'link\': \'https://www.custommarketinsights.com/report/management-consulting-market/\'}], \'relatedSearches\': [{\'query\': \'Global market forces affecting management consulting 2024 2025 salary\'}, {\'query\': \'Global market forces affecting management consulting 2024 2025 pdf\'}, {\'query\': \'Global market forces affecting management consulting 2024 2025 mckinsey\'}, {\'query\': \'Management consulting market size\'}, {\'query\': \'Global consulting market size\'}, {\'query\': \'Management consulting market size us\'}, {\'query\': \'Consulting layoffs 2025\'}, {\'query\': \'Management consulting industry outlook\'}], \'credits\': 1}'}], 'temperature': 0.1, 'stop': ['\nObservation:'], 'max_tokens': 8000, 'extra_body': {}}'
